  "description": "A self-governing Caribbean island and an unincorporated territory of the United States. It has its own culture, language (Spanish), and history, but is not an independent country. The meme's altered text 'Cinco de ported!' is a deliberate misspelling to imply 'Cinco de Puerto Rico,' which is not a real holiday, and uses the American flag to falsely associate the celebration with Puerto Rico, implying a cultural appropriation or mockery.",
